# Frontend dependencies (HUD Svelte app).
# No trailing slash: also ignore a stray `node_modules` *symlink* — a
# self-referential one slipped past the dir-only pattern, got committed, and
# ELOOPed `pnpm install` whenever the checkout path matched the symlink target.
node_modules
.pnpm-store/

