# --- Local-only Loom planning artifacts (per workspace AGENTS.md policy) ---
# Root-level .loom/*.md and *.json stay tracked for multi-agent visibility;
# these auto-generated / ephemeral / archived artifacts are local-only.
.loom/local/
.loom/archive/
.loom/00-workspace-snapshot.md
.loom/50-worklog.md
